Artwork provenance
------------------

Every raster asset in skins/lucy-nightsignal/assets/ was generated with AI
through the OFOX image API and then processed locally:

- scene-light.webp / scene-dark.webp — text-to-image with
  `volcengine/doubao-seedream-5.0-pro` (opaque RGB scenes, no characters).
- lucy-signal-left.webp / lucy-signal-right.webp — text-to-image with
  `volcengine/doubao-seedream-5.0-pro` on a flat magenta (#FF00FF) plate,
  then locally chroma-keyed, colour-unmixed, despilled, alpha-floored and
  despeckled with tools/matte.py (see docs/ART-PROVENANCE.md for the exact
  recipe, prompts and per-file digests).

No photograph, cosplay image, or other third-party picture was uploaded to the
image provider: the character design was described in text only.

